# Code owners (R-52). GitHub asks the code owners for a review on every pull
# request and sends them a notification. The last matching line wins, so the
# paths below also keep the owner on them.
# When a developer joins, the owner adds their GitHub username to each line,
# for example:  *  @Juthyra @their-username
# GitHub never asks the author of a pull request to review it.
*                 @Juthyra
/docs/prd/        @Juthyra
/docs/decisions/  @Juthyra
/docs/registers/  @Juthyra
/AGENTS.md        @Juthyra
